API Endpoints
Method	Endpoint	Purpose
POST	/api/employees	Add Employee
GET	/api/employees	View Employees
GET	/api/employees?search=john	Search Employees
GET	/api/employees?status=ACTIVE	Filter Active Employees
GET	/api/employees?search=john&status=ACTIVE	Search + Filter
GET	/api/employees/:id	View Employee
PUT	/api/employees/:id	Edit Employee
DELETE	/api/employees/:id	Delete Employee

Asset API Endpoints
Method	URL	Description
POST	/api/assets	Create Asset
GET	/api/assets	Get All Assets (with search/filter)
GET	/api/assets/:id	Get Asset by ID
PUT	/api/assets/:id	Update Asset
DELETE	/api/assets/:id	Delete Asset (or soft delete)


